  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sonke -St&#xF6;d till MenEngage Africa Network 2011-   2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sonke-Support of MenEngage Africa Network 2011-   2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MenEngage is a global network of organisations working for more equitable gender relations and improved SRHR through attitude and behavioral change among men and boys. Sonke Gender Justice Network is the regional coordinating organisation for the MenEngage Africa network. A planning grant has been given to Sonke to develop a regional programme for capacity buiding of the coutry networks, plus</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MenEngage &#xE4;r ett globalt n&#xE4;tverk som arbetar f&#xF6;r att engagera m&#xE4;n i j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhetsarbete och f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xE4;lsa, genom attityd och beteendef&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndringar hos pojkar och m&#xE4;n. Sinke Gender Justice network &#xE4;r samordnande f&#xF6;r MenEngage Africa network. Sonke har beviljats ett planeringsansklag f&#xF6;r att ta fram en regional ans&#xF6;kan f&#xF6;r att st&#xE4;rka nationella n&#xE4;tverk</narrative>
  </description>
